      "content": "Accepting Sell executions also requires updating the entry-analysis helpers. `deviationsOf`, `legFulfillmentOf`, and `entryWindowOf` still add every execution's quantity as entered quantity regardless of action. For example, PC1 + PC2 + X1 creates a spurious EntrySize excess of 30 for X1, and selling after a partial entry can falsely resolve the entry window. Exclude disposals from entry quantities/window calculations and apply the intended open-quantity semantics to deviation detection.",
