      "category": "bug",
      "severity": "high"
    },
    {
      "path": "src/domain/trade-analysis/derive.ts",
      "content": "If a Sell exceeds available inventory (or precedes its opening buys in Fact Order), this loop silently discards the unmatched remainder. `incoherence` currently checks only IDs, planned-leg references, and positive quantities, so such input returns Derived with an incorrect position and incomplete realized P\u0026L/disposal-fee allocation. Reject insufficient inventory with a typed incoherence finding before returning financial results.",
